WEBVTT

01:06.920 --> 01:08.310
What happened here?

01:08.384 --> 01:10.144
Daozhou has been hit by severe flooding.

01:10.430 --> 01:12.280
We all fled here to escape the disaster.

01:18.510 --> 01:18.950
Here.

01:27.280 --> 01:28.150
It's so hot.

01:28.752 --> 01:30.920
Use our carriage to take her
to the medical clinic.

01:31.040 --> 01:31.510
All right.

01:33.510 --> 01:33.950
Here.

01:34.150 --> 01:35.120
Thank you, Young Lady.

01:36.040 --> 01:36.790
Thank you.

01:44.784 --> 01:46.310
I'll have the local magistrate's office

01:46.310 --> 01:47.824
arrange shelter for these refugees.

03:11.216 --> 03:12.110
=Blossoms of Power=

03:12.112 --> 03:15.060
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

03:15.140 --> 03:18.100
=Episode 29=

03:18.310 --> 03:19.080
Here.

03:19.080 --> 03:21.190
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

03:26.080 --> 03:27.280
- One for me, Lady.
- Here.

03:27.750 --> 03:28.560
Thank you.

03:29.080 --> 03:30.280
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

03:30.750 --> 03:31.630
Thank you.

03:31.630 --> 03:32.310
Here you go.

03:32.470 --> 03:33.280
Thank you.

03:37.840 --> 03:38.280
Here.

03:44.190 --> 03:44.800
Thank you.

03:44.800 --> 03:45.360
Drink slowly.

03:45.360 --> 03:46.590
Thank you, Sister.

03:48.470 --> 03:49.590
Go bring two more bowls.

03:49.590 --> 03:50.120
Yes.

03:55.080 --> 03:56.190
You've worked hard.

03:59.190 --> 04:00.430
I just looked around.

04:00.710 --> 04:03.960
Food, shelter, and supplies to keep out
the damp and cold are all well prepared.

04:04.840 --> 04:07.360
You have made excellent arrangements.

04:07.870 --> 04:09.120
It is my duty.

04:09.750 --> 04:10.960
Thank you for your praise.

04:11.190 --> 04:12.400
I have a few suggestions.

04:12.520 --> 04:14.048
I'm not sure if they're appropriate.

04:14.120 --> 04:14.750
Please.

04:14.840 --> 04:16.830
We should have more ginger tea prepared

04:17.120 --> 04:18.160
to help prevent colds.

04:19.120 --> 04:20.870
Also, colds are contagious.

04:20.944 --> 04:22.752
If those who are sick
aren't isolated in time,

04:22.816 --> 04:24.240
they could spread it to others.

04:24.390 --> 04:26.120
The refugees
should be housed separately.

04:26.120 --> 04:27.680
That would be more appropriate.

04:27.800 --> 04:29.310
You are absolutely right.

04:29.870 --> 04:30.720
On this matter,

04:31.070 --> 04:32.630
I was indeed negligent.

04:34.160 --> 04:35.240
Thank you for the reminder.

04:36.600 --> 04:39.390
Physicians and medicine
are both in short supply in town.

04:39.920 --> 04:41.510
Mo Yu is my personal physician.

04:41.830 --> 04:44.040
I'll leave her here for you
to call on at any time.

04:44.656 --> 04:46.160
As for the medicine in the carriage,

04:46.160 --> 04:47.720
have her bring all of it over as well.

04:48.390 --> 04:49.480
On behalf of the people,

04:49.600 --> 04:50.680
thank you.

05:13.480 --> 05:14.360
You're back.

05:20.830 --> 05:21.630
I'm back.

05:29.104 --> 05:30.600
Changqing, you've worked hard today.

05:31.184 --> 05:32.830
You still have
many matters to attend to.

05:34.680 --> 05:35.600
In that case,

05:36.270 --> 05:37.240
I'll take my leave.

05:39.160 --> 05:41.190
If Your Highnesses need anything,

05:41.190 --> 05:42.528
just send someone to let me know.

05:44.000 --> 05:44.510
By the way,

05:44.896 --> 05:47.630
I heard you gave up your horse
to take a refugee to the medical clinic

05:47.750 --> 05:48.870
and walked here yourself.

05:49.152 --> 05:50.900
These medicines
will help keep out the cold.

05:50.944 --> 05:52.032
You should find them useful.

05:55.120 --> 05:56.000
Thank you, Changqing.

05:58.400 --> 05:59.240
I'll take my leave.

06:15.920 --> 06:17.480
Here, warm yourself up.

06:46.240 --> 06:47.360
I'll do it myself.

07:12.240 --> 07:12.920
Is it too hot?

07:30.560 --> 07:31.720
You've worked hard today.

07:34.070 --> 07:35.240
What I could do

07:36.120 --> 07:37.920
was only to address
the immediate crisis.

07:38.944 --> 07:41.584
The people who managed to escape
are already suffering like this.

07:42.680 --> 07:44.720
Those still trapped in Wudeng County

07:45.190 --> 07:46.480
must be in even worse shape.

07:46.560 --> 07:49.456
Right now, they lack everything
from food and clothing to shelter.

07:50.000 --> 07:51.510
Medicine is the highest priority.

07:56.240 --> 07:57.240
Whatever they need,

07:57.600 --> 07:58.390
we'll send it.

07:58.390 --> 07:59.070
Send it?

08:00.800 --> 08:02.310
The roads leading to Wudeng County

08:02.310 --> 08:03.680
have almost all been destroyed.

08:04.600 --> 08:06.430
Even if we gather
enough relief supplies,

08:06.870 --> 08:08.830
getting them safely
into the people's hands

08:08.920 --> 08:10.160
would be nearly impossible.

08:12.310 --> 08:13.630
Then we'll deliver them by air.

08:14.750 --> 08:15.830
What do you mean?

08:39.952 --> 08:42.320
(Daozhou Granary Records)
This is the inventory record of

08:42.330 --> 08:44.016
all the grain and supplies in Daozhou.

08:44.064 --> 08:45.264
(Daozhou Granary Records: Medicine)

08:51.200 --> 08:52.750
At this rate, in less than five days,

08:52.840 --> 08:54.800
Daozhou will run out
of both food and medicine.

08:55.030 --> 08:56.600
So what exactly is your plan?

08:56.704 --> 08:57.840
Stop keeping me in suspense.

08:58.870 --> 08:59.720
Look at this map.

09:01.728 --> 09:04.550
(Daozhou Zhaoshui Wharf)
Supplies will be loaded onto ships

09:04.624 --> 09:06.416
at the wharf,
then transported into Daozhou,

09:06.420 --> 09:08.130
before being redirected
onto this waterway.

09:08.150 --> 09:10.200
This waterway
wasn't affected by the flooding.

09:10.510 --> 09:11.510
The current is gentle,

09:11.510 --> 09:12.700
making it suitable for docking.

09:12.752 --> 09:14.336
It's also the closest route to Daozhou.

09:14.600 --> 09:18.080
Then I'll have people drive several
wooden posts into both riverbanks,

09:18.112 --> 09:19.392
and connect them with iron cables.

09:19.400 --> 09:21.320
The supplies will
be tightly wrapped in oilcloth

09:21.440 --> 09:23.120
and sent across by cable.

09:23.232 --> 09:25.696
From there, they'll
be transported to Wudeng County.

09:26.390 --> 09:27.440
That way,

09:27.440 --> 09:28.440
it'll be much faster.

09:28.910 --> 09:30.440
If we build several more cableways,

09:30.510 --> 09:32.080
even large amounts of grain and cloth

09:32.390 --> 09:33.840
can be delivered within a day or two.

09:34.390 --> 09:34.960
Exactly.

09:36.000 --> 09:37.030
How did you come up with

09:37.030 --> 09:38.030
such a brilliant idea?

09:40.320 --> 09:41.440
You flatter me.

09:43.200 --> 09:44.910
When I traveled the country years ago,

09:45.240 --> 09:47.240
I saw mountain villagers

09:47.240 --> 09:49.000
using this very method
to transport grain.

09:49.000 --> 09:50.630
If the cableway is sturdy enough,

09:50.630 --> 09:51.910
it can even carry people.

09:54.600 --> 09:56.200
I merely adapted what I saw.

09:56.200 --> 09:57.264
When all is said and done,

09:57.720 --> 09:59.150
the people are the wisest of all.

10:07.790 --> 10:09.200
Seeing the Crown Prince,

10:09.200 --> 10:11.480
so full of the warmth of everyday life,

10:11.480 --> 10:12.720
puts everyone even more at ease.

10:19.510 --> 10:21.000
Why are your hands so cold?

10:26.624 --> 10:28.910
You know I've always
been sensitive to the cold.

10:29.630 --> 10:30.480
It's nothing serious.

10:34.870 --> 10:35.630
Your Highness,

10:35.750 --> 10:37.550
I dared to come
to the imperial capital alone

10:38.000 --> 10:39.670
and step into the Imperial Palace.

10:39.728 --> 10:41.792
That means I have
the confidence to keep going.

10:41.872 --> 10:43.344
You don't need to worry about me.

10:44.000 --> 10:46.390
Just focus on getting yourself well.

10:50.550 --> 10:52.240
Of course I know that
better than anyone.

10:55.030 --> 10:56.080
I only

10:57.030 --> 10:58.510
want to treat you even better.

11:04.360 --> 11:05.790
Since the day we met,

11:06.000 --> 11:07.550
I've benefited from you in so many ways,

11:09.120 --> 11:10.360
yet I've never...

11:10.360 --> 11:11.200
Between you and me,

11:12.080 --> 11:14.064
there's never any need to say thank you.

11:17.550 --> 11:19.480
I want to thank you
for coming into my life

11:20.390 --> 11:21.870
like a gift from heaven.

11:23.120 --> 11:25.510
Thank you for loving me so deeply,

11:26.240 --> 11:28.600
for being honest with me
and giving me your whole heart.

11:30.240 --> 11:32.080
To have become your wife,

11:32.320 --> 11:33.480
I have no regrets.

12:06.480 --> 12:08.600
I establish a nation

12:08.600 --> 12:10.270
for the well-being of its people,

12:10.270 --> 12:11.960
and put ending tyranny first.

12:11.960 --> 12:15.870
The Crown Prince Xiao Huayong
and Crown Princess Shen,

12:15.960 --> 12:18.910
who stood fast in a city under siege
and steadied the army's morale,

12:19.030 --> 12:21.000
have rendered
great service in turning the tide.

12:21.010 --> 12:22.570
Therefore, we bestow upon Crown Prince

12:22.580 --> 12:24.710
and Crown Princess
one pair of Dongzhu pearls each,

12:24.720 --> 12:26.270
and a pair of jade ruyi,

12:26.270 --> 12:28.120
in recognition
of their meritorious service.

12:28.720 --> 12:30.720
Prince Xin Xiao Changqing

12:30.720 --> 12:34.510
killed the rebel general on the
battlefield, boosting the army's morale.

12:34.870 --> 12:39.080
Therefore, I bestow upon Prince Xin
50 kg of gold and 100 bolts of brocade.

12:39.600 --> 12:41.480
Prince Ding Xiao Changtai.

12:41.480 --> 12:44.320
For inciting rebellion,
his crime is unforgivable.

12:44.368 --> 12:46.480
All prefectures
and counties along the route

12:46.496 --> 12:48.480
are ordered to search
for and apprehend him.

12:48.600 --> 12:52.000
Once captured, he shall be escorted back
to the imperial capital immediately.

12:52.150 --> 12:54.510
No member of the Imperial Clan
shall show favoritism.

12:54.510 --> 12:56.510
Let this decree be carried out.

12:56.510 --> 12:59.580
(East Palace)

13:43.550 --> 13:45.320
Why can't you sleep?

13:51.000 --> 13:52.150
I've been thinking

13:54.630 --> 13:56.440
about seeing Father

13:58.120 --> 13:59.840
and Grandmother today.

14:01.510 --> 14:03.200
Grandmother said

14:04.080 --> 14:05.960
that the two of us, as husband and wife,

14:06.352 --> 14:08.270
must safeguard the peace
of the realm together.

14:09.150 --> 14:10.720
Do you think

14:10.800 --> 14:12.992
the burden on your shoulders
has grown heavier?

14:17.080 --> 14:18.270
That's not it.

14:20.720 --> 14:21.790
Then what is it?

14:29.840 --> 14:31.200
Grandmother said...

14:39.000 --> 14:40.630
she wants to have a great-grandchild.

15:10.510 --> 15:11.910
You really can't sleep?

15:15.320 --> 15:17.630
Earlier today,

15:18.550 --> 15:19.600
we played a game of chess,

15:20.030 --> 15:21.200
but it ended without a winner.

15:21.720 --> 15:23.440
Why don't we finish it now?

15:26.960 --> 15:28.320
I don't feel like playing chess.

15:32.390 --> 15:34.150
At the hunting grounds last month,

15:34.440 --> 15:35.670
during the polo match,

15:36.240 --> 15:38.670
didn't you say it ended too soon?

15:39.360 --> 15:40.870
Then let's get up and chat.

15:42.320 --> 15:44.112
I don't feel like talking about polo.

15:49.480 --> 15:50.200
How about this?

15:51.000 --> 15:54.390
I'll prepare
a calming incense blend for you.

15:55.550 --> 15:57.720
Would you like to try it?

16:08.790 --> 16:09.960
I don't feel like trying it.

16:34.070 --> 16:37.140
♪Time passes like a dream♪

16:38.210 --> 16:40.820
♪Pushing the sea
of stars to flow across♪

16:42.260 --> 16:44.840
♪Flowers wilt and bloom again♪

16:45.790 --> 16:47.000
Stop it.

16:49.910 --> 16:50.960
I thought

16:52.630 --> 16:54.150
I'd already made myself clear.

16:54.160 --> 16:56.840
♪Gently spreading through the blossoms♪

16:57.640 --> 16:59.510
♪How sweet this yearning is♪

16:59.750 --> 17:04.190
♪Yet who among us still roams
like we did when we were young?♪

17:06.150 --> 17:08.820
♪Amidst the flickering lights♪

17:10.180 --> 17:12.890
♪Alone for several autumns♪

17:14.280 --> 17:16.730
♪How to choose the one♪

17:17.110 --> 17:20.670
♪To be with forever?♪

17:21.750 --> 17:25.040
♪When I gaze upon you♪

17:25.670 --> 17:28.560
♪Flower petals twirl gently in my heart♪

17:28.590 --> 17:29.720
Actually,

17:29.720 --> 17:31.280
I think the Crown Prince is quite good.

17:31.790 --> 17:33.200
Of course you do.

17:34.460 --> 17:36.260
(Clarity and Serenity)

17:36.480 --> 17:38.160
See? I told you they weren't asleep yet.

17:40.510 --> 17:44.120
♪Quietly reflect in your sparkling eyes♪

17:45.290 --> 17:47.060
♪Scattered red petals fall like rain♪

17:47.110 --> 17:48.080
See? I told you.

17:48.100 --> 17:50.440
The Crown Prince may look every bit
the perfect gentleman,

17:50.440 --> 17:52.480
but he's really a shameless flirt.

17:53.000 --> 17:54.750
You can't say that.

17:57.110 --> 17:57.830
Let's go.

18:00.220 --> 18:03.180
(Clarity and Serenity)

18:04.490 --> 18:08.000
♪Not a trace of sorrow can be found♪

18:25.650 --> 18:32.510
♪And a pool of me♪

18:33.920 --> 18:35.110
Your Highness.

18:35.590 --> 18:37.400
You have court tomorrow.

18:38.400 --> 18:39.240
I know.

18:40.640 --> 18:42.200
Then behave yourself.

18:44.160 --> 18:45.550
How can I behave

18:46.440 --> 18:47.750
with you beside me?

19:11.216 --> 19:12.920
You have been awake for quite some time.

19:13.072 --> 19:14.736
Why haven't you gotten dressed yet?

19:23.920 --> 19:25.400
Getting dressed

19:25.790 --> 19:27.550
has always been Tian Yuan's duty.

19:30.830 --> 19:31.830
Now,

19:32.310 --> 19:33.590
I have a wife.

19:33.960 --> 19:35.310
Would you still leave

19:35.472 --> 19:37.160
something this personal to someone else?

19:39.070 --> 19:40.310
What if I say no?

19:41.030 --> 19:43.440
We agreed to treat
each other with mutual respect.

19:43.616 --> 19:45.648
My arms are getting tired
from holding them up.

21:20.960 --> 21:21.790
Turn around.

22:03.030 --> 22:04.070
What are you doing?

22:04.560 --> 22:06.720
Since we're to treat
each other with mutual respect,

22:07.110 --> 22:08.400
then let me

22:08.680 --> 22:09.920
do something for you as well.

22:25.720 --> 22:26.550
I'll do it myself.

22:26.960 --> 22:28.310
You don't need to do my makeup...

22:29.350 --> 22:30.110
Hold still.

22:30.944 --> 22:32.544
Be careful, or it'll come out crooked.

22:33.400 --> 22:35.650
♪Frost that melts at a single smile♪

22:36.970 --> 22:42.250
♪How can you be this wonderful♪

22:44.180 --> 22:47.120
♪I've hidden so many words♪

22:47.740 --> 22:50.540
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

22:51.410 --> 22:58.380
♪So never uncover♪

22:58.570 --> 23:00.930
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

23:02.060 --> 23:04.790
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

23:05.750 --> 23:11.090
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

23:12.850 --> 23:15.670
♪Every answer I gave♪

23:16.470 --> 23:19.320
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

23:20.110 --> 23:23.480
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

23:23.740 --> 23:27.050
♪How hard it truly was?♪

23:30.020 --> 23:33.460
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

23:34.450 --> 23:36.780
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

23:38.050 --> 23:41.050
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

23:41.070 --> 23:42.640
Every look you wear

23:44.200 --> 23:45.680
leaves everyone in awe.

23:46.110 --> 23:47.680
The noble ladies

23:48.270 --> 23:49.480
all rush to imitate her.

23:50.750 --> 23:51.550
Today,

23:52.080 --> 23:54.576
it's sure to become
the latest fashion throughout the city.

23:58.560 --> 24:02.230
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

24:03.100 --> 24:05.860
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

24:06.300 --> 24:09.430
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

24:09.870 --> 24:16.240
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

24:17.410 --> 24:23.120
♪The flustered mortal world♪

24:26.480 --> 24:27.310
Done.

24:48.580 --> 24:51.940
(Cultivate Virtue
and Practice Righteousness)

24:51.960 --> 24:53.830
This is the list of palace maids to
be released under the general amnesty.

24:53.920 --> 24:56.270
Palace Domestic Service and Court of
Imperial Clan Affairs have verified it.

24:56.350 --> 24:57.600
No one has been overlooked.

25:02.640 --> 25:04.240
Go with the palace attendants from

25:04.304 --> 25:05.750
the Palace Domestic Service yourself.

25:05.760 --> 25:07.920
Make sure every palace maid
leaves the palace safely.

25:08.110 --> 25:08.750
Go on.

25:08.960 --> 25:09.440
Yes.

25:15.070 --> 25:15.920
Your Highness.

25:16.032 --> 25:17.550
His Majesty has just issued a decree.

25:17.550 --> 25:19.270
Prince Xin has been rewarded
for suppressing the rebellion.

25:19.270 --> 25:21.490
Noble Consort Rong has been
restored to her former rank.

25:23.680 --> 25:24.240
Come.

25:24.790 --> 25:26.590
Let's go congratulate
Noble Consort Rong.

25:45.640 --> 25:46.830
Greetings, Noble Consort Rong.

25:48.720 --> 25:50.224
Thank you for coming.

25:50.336 --> 25:52.540
After His Majesty granted amnesty
to the inner palace,

25:52.550 --> 25:55.110
the palace maids of Hanzhang Hall
were also included on the list.

25:55.120 --> 25:57.400
So I have prepared
some newly assigned palace maids

25:57.550 --> 25:58.550
for you.

25:58.960 --> 25:59.920
Starting today,

26:00.350 --> 26:02.440
you will all serve at Hanzhang Hall.

26:03.030 --> 26:03.830
- Yes.
- Yes.

26:06.160 --> 26:07.160
Their assignments

26:07.296 --> 26:08.680
will be entirely at your discretion.

26:09.000 --> 26:10.480
Thank you for your thoughtfulness.

26:15.660 --> 26:18.380
(Sixian Hall)

26:23.440 --> 26:24.310
Your Highness.

26:25.616 --> 26:26.680
Is the Crown Princess here?

26:26.960 --> 26:28.000
She's in the side hall.

26:28.880 --> 26:30.400
Her Highness is blending incense.

26:30.448 --> 26:31.500
Please wait a moment.

26:31.510 --> 26:32.680
I'll inform her right away.

26:33.350 --> 26:34.000
No need.

26:34.790 --> 26:36.000
I'll wait for her here.

26:36.112 --> 26:37.216
Go on with your work.

26:37.720 --> 26:38.310
Yes.

27:00.680 --> 27:01.550
Your Highness?

27:05.270 --> 27:06.480
When did you get here?

27:06.576 --> 27:07.680
Just a little while ago.

27:08.160 --> 27:09.110
Why didn't you come in?

27:09.440 --> 27:10.410
Mo Yu told me

27:10.420 --> 27:12.580
you don't like being disturbed
while blending incense,

27:12.590 --> 27:13.680
so I waited outside.

27:13.680 --> 27:14.550
Mo Yu?

27:15.936 --> 27:18.240
I sent her to lay out
the incense ingredients to dry.

27:18.310 --> 27:20.110
That was two hours ago.

27:20.592 --> 27:22.070
You've been waiting that long?

27:22.720 --> 27:24.030
This is the East Palace.

27:24.680 --> 27:26.590
There's nowhere you can't go.

27:26.880 --> 27:28.590
I didn't want to break your rules.

27:29.400 --> 27:30.480
Between husband and wife,

27:30.830 --> 27:32.110
respect matters even more.

27:35.480 --> 27:36.550
I used to think

27:36.880 --> 27:39.480
marriage meant making compromises.

27:40.160 --> 27:41.400
But now I think

27:41.830 --> 27:43.550
we're even more at ease

27:43.550 --> 27:44.864
than we were before we married.

27:46.160 --> 27:46.590
Come.

29:02.720 --> 29:03.960
What are you looking at?

29:03.960 --> 29:04.880
That's quite a stack.

29:05.920 --> 29:09.328
Princess Anling's wedding to the newly
crowned top scholar is fast approaching.

29:09.750 --> 29:11.790
Everything from the betrothal gifts

29:11.800 --> 29:13.350
to the dowry and ceremonial procession

29:13.350 --> 29:14.510
must be reviewed carefully.

29:14.590 --> 29:15.510
Besides,

29:15.830 --> 29:17.880
several palace halls

29:17.880 --> 29:19.420
were recently found to be in disrepair.

29:19.440 --> 29:20.790
These plans and cost estimates

29:20.920 --> 29:22.352
must also be reviewed one by one.

29:37.720 --> 29:38.640
Look at you.

29:38.880 --> 29:40.640
Your eyes are bloodshot
from overworking.

29:46.160 --> 29:47.400
The affairs of the Six Palaces

29:47.510 --> 29:48.590
will never be finished.

29:49.240 --> 29:50.070
Take a break first.

29:50.310 --> 29:51.750
I hate seeing you work so hard.

29:54.830 --> 29:57.720
If you hate seeing me work so hard,

29:58.030 --> 29:59.200
then perhaps

29:59.680 --> 30:02.480
you could help me with some of it.

30:08.000 --> 30:09.400
Helping my beloved wife

30:09.550 --> 30:10.510
is only right.

30:26.270 --> 30:27.960
Take care of your work.

30:29.400 --> 30:30.240
As you command.

30:39.270 --> 30:39.750
By the way,

30:40.624 --> 30:43.110
Father knows how exhausting
the trip to the northwest was,

30:43.120 --> 30:45.440
so he has invited the Imperial Clan
to the hunting grounds

30:45.472 --> 30:46.640
to relax for a few days.

30:47.750 --> 30:49.680
Changqing will accompany us,

30:49.760 --> 30:51.840
and Changying
will be responsible for security.

30:52.704 --> 30:54.432
Many thanks for His Majesty's grace.

31:54.110 --> 31:55.070
Your Highness,

31:55.760 --> 31:57.024
what is the meaning of this?

31:57.720 --> 31:58.400
Changqing.

31:58.528 --> 31:59.680
This deer is still young.

31:59.830 --> 32:00.550
Let it go.

32:58.288 --> 32:59.480
Watch out, Changqing!

33:23.550 --> 33:25.750
Isn't this the one
the Crown Prince took?

33:26.000 --> 33:27.550
You haven't even finished the edging.

33:31.830 --> 33:32.590
Your Highness.

33:32.880 --> 33:34.160
The Crown Prince is missing.

33:34.920 --> 33:35.680
What?

33:35.744 --> 33:37.790
His Highness and the other princes
were ambushed

33:37.790 --> 33:38.950
while hunting in the mountains.

33:38.960 --> 33:41.310
The Crown Prince and Prince Xin
have both gone missing.

33:41.550 --> 33:43.480
Who would dare abduct a prince

33:43.480 --> 33:44.768
under His Majesty's very nose?

33:44.800 --> 33:45.488
Your Highness,

33:45.490 --> 33:47.300
could it be the one
who poisoned His Highness?

33:47.310 --> 33:47.880
No.

33:48.512 --> 33:50.110
That person has always acted in secret.

33:50.352 --> 33:52.000
They wouldn't make such a big commotion.

33:52.000 --> 33:52.920
In my opinion,

33:53.000 --> 33:54.400
whoever abducted the Crown Prince

33:54.400 --> 33:55.440
has another purpose.

33:55.440 --> 33:56.920
Until that purpose is revealed,

33:56.960 --> 33:58.780
His Highness's life
should not be in danger.

33:58.790 --> 34:00.790
Should we send Crown Prince's
guards to search?

34:00.790 --> 34:02.000
And my guards as well.

34:02.240 --> 34:04.350
Under my orders.

34:05.456 --> 34:07.550
The people I have hidden
in the Imperial Capital

34:07.560 --> 34:09.360
were all placed there
by the Duke and the Heir

34:09.376 --> 34:11.280
for your protection
in case of emergencies.

34:11.400 --> 34:12.630
If we send them all out,

34:12.656 --> 34:13.920
their identities will be exposed.

34:14.760 --> 34:15.840
Every moment we lose

34:15.840 --> 34:17.392
puts His Highness in greater danger.

34:17.710 --> 34:19.550
I can't risk the Crown Prince's life.

34:20.000 --> 34:21.030
I'm going with you.

34:50.480 --> 34:51.880
The place is heavily guarded.

34:53.000 --> 34:54.360
Breaking out

34:54.920 --> 34:56.030
will be nearly impossible.

35:04.510 --> 35:05.070
Stop.

35:07.360 --> 35:08.630
Why did you

35:09.030 --> 35:10.110
abduct us?

35:22.360 --> 35:23.880
Whatever their purpose is,

35:24.320 --> 35:26.150
they've brought us food and water.

35:26.760 --> 35:28.440
At least they won't kill us for now.

35:28.760 --> 35:29.800
The one behind all this

35:29.888 --> 35:31.712
will reveal themselves sooner or later.

35:42.280 --> 35:42.880
Changqing.

35:45.320 --> 35:45.960
Changqing.

35:49.280 --> 35:50.150
Changqing!

35:51.670 --> 35:52.480
What is it?

35:53.800 --> 35:54.960
I'm hurt.

35:55.230 --> 35:56.840
Could you bandage it for me?

36:01.230 --> 36:02.480
It hurts.

36:27.480 --> 36:29.710
You're always upset whenever you see me.

36:31.120 --> 36:32.280
What are you upset about?

36:33.510 --> 36:34.670
Are you upset

36:34.920 --> 36:36.030
that I admire Xihe,

36:36.840 --> 36:38.110
or that Xihe

36:38.110 --> 36:39.190
has feelings for me?

36:43.840 --> 36:45.150
If I die here,

36:46.480 --> 36:48.000
you won't escape the blame either.

37:16.030 --> 37:16.670
Changqing.

37:18.760 --> 37:20.190
Take my advice.

37:22.800 --> 37:25.110
Give up those resentful thoughts.

37:31.880 --> 37:34.150
Haven't you always been
the one who plans ahead

37:34.150 --> 37:35.110
and wins from afar?

37:36.800 --> 37:37.440
What?

37:38.112 --> 37:40.510
Are you really afraid
someone admires Crown Princess?

37:45.360 --> 37:46.480
I'm annoyed.

37:49.320 --> 37:51.110
Who could tolerate

37:51.440 --> 37:52.880
someone coveting their wife?

37:54.710 --> 37:56.360
If you're really that narrow-minded,

37:56.670 --> 37:58.510
you'll never find peace in this life.

37:59.030 --> 38:00.710
A lady like Xihe

38:00.800 --> 38:02.880
will naturally
attract countless admirers.

38:03.280 --> 38:04.320
Besides,

38:05.230 --> 38:06.630
you don't have...

38:08.230 --> 38:09.400
I knew it.

38:09.400 --> 38:12.030
Some people spend every day
hoping something happens to me

38:12.840 --> 38:14.110
so they can take advantage of it.

38:37.550 --> 38:40.070
What a beautiful full moon.

38:46.150 --> 38:47.320
What moon?

38:47.320 --> 38:48.670
Exactly. What moon?

38:48.720 --> 38:50.736
Something that doesn't exist
simply doesn't exist.

38:50.800 --> 38:52.880
No matter how much you chase it,
or long for it,

38:53.440 --> 38:54.960
isn't that just wishful thinking

38:55.110 --> 38:56.280
and self-deception?

39:00.440 --> 39:01.360
Do you believe

39:01.952 --> 39:03.760
I'll kill you with a knife right now?

39:04.320 --> 39:05.400
I do, Changqing.

39:06.280 --> 39:07.280
But right now,

39:07.392 --> 39:08.440
you don't have a knife.

39:29.670 --> 39:30.920
Enough.

39:32.280 --> 39:33.710
Stop saying things that annoy me.

39:33.800 --> 39:34.670
Get some rest.

40:27.880 --> 40:28.630
I'm hungry.

40:28.800 --> 40:30.070
Don't you have hands and feet?

40:39.000 --> 40:40.400
Don't you think

40:40.448 --> 40:42.480
that your chain is longer
and mine is shorter,

40:42.640 --> 40:44.480
so it'd be easier for you
to take care of me?

40:49.880 --> 40:51.150
That's right.

40:52.000 --> 40:54.400
I'll outlive you.

41:07.480 --> 41:08.000
Come on.

41:37.960 --> 41:38.510
Huayong.

41:39.550 --> 41:40.110
Huayong.

41:40.590 --> 41:41.280
What's wrong?

41:43.000 --> 41:43.710
Are you alright?

41:46.480 --> 41:47.070
Huayong.

41:49.590 --> 41:50.400
Are you alright?

41:58.880 --> 42:00.000
After all these years,

42:01.376 --> 42:04.030
this is the first time
I've felt brotherly affection from you.

42:06.000 --> 42:07.360
It feels so warm.

42:16.992 --> 42:18.880
The hatred between us
over the lady we love

42:19.190 --> 42:20.190
can never be reconciled.

42:21.150 --> 42:22.400
What brotherly affection?

42:25.440 --> 42:27.190
Why don't you understand?

42:29.000 --> 42:30.920
No one can decide Xihe's future.

42:31.568 --> 42:33.344
Even if she is
that person from the past,

42:34.440 --> 42:36.590
all she wants now is to be Shen Xihe.

42:37.230 --> 42:38.590
That is her choice.

42:45.760 --> 42:46.590
I believe

42:48.670 --> 42:50.070
no one but me

42:52.360 --> 42:54.360
would dare marry
the former Crown Princess.

42:57.360 --> 42:58.360
In the end,

42:59.280 --> 43:00.840
she'll come back to me.

43:07.150 --> 43:09.710
Xihe is a phoenix
soaring across the heavens.

43:10.280 --> 43:11.440
She is free.

43:11.440 --> 43:13.330
She was meant
to look down upon the world,

43:13.344 --> 43:14.480
not to belong to anyone.

43:15.400 --> 43:17.480
If you still can't understand that,

43:17.960 --> 43:19.320
then the bond between you two

43:19.960 --> 43:20.960
ended long ago.

43:41.920 --> 43:43.360
Haven't you always wanted to know

43:43.510 --> 43:45.150
who poisoned you?

43:45.150 --> 43:47.344
I can tell you the truth right now.

43:47.350 --> 43:49.568
If I can't find the Crown Prince,
I'm not going back.

43:50.180 --> 43:51.900
♪A wall that falls with a single push♪

43:51.920 --> 43:52.550
Your Highness.

43:52.840 --> 43:53.710
Your Highness!

43:53.710 --> 43:56.010
♪Frost that melts at a single smile♪

43:56.030 --> 43:57.110
Are you still tired?

43:57.280 --> 43:58.150
With you here,

43:58.360 --> 43:59.280
everything is alright.

44:04.430 --> 44:07.370
♪I've hidden so many words♪

44:07.990 --> 44:10.790
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

44:11.660 --> 44:18.630
♪So never uncover♪

44:18.820 --> 44:21.180
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

44:22.310 --> 44:25.040
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

44:26.000 --> 44:31.340
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

44:33.100 --> 44:35.920
♪Every answer I gave♪

44:36.720 --> 44:39.570
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

44:40.360 --> 44:43.730
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

44:43.990 --> 44:47.300
♪How hard it truly was?♪

44:50.270 --> 44:53.710
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

44:54.700 --> 44:57.030
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

44:58.300 --> 45:04.060
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

45:05.470 --> 45:08.600
♪It's a shame I never could♪

45:09.050 --> 45:12.060
♪Give you a moon in return♪

45:12.170 --> 45:18.810
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

45:18.810 --> 45:22.480
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

45:23.350 --> 45:26.110
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

45:26.550 --> 45:29.680
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

45:30.120 --> 45:36.070
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

45:37.470 --> 45:41.020
♪You'll never♪

45:41.300 --> 45:50.770
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

46:16.940 --> 46:20.420
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
